         ["MultiCare Tacoma General and Allenmore", "Virginia Mason Franciscan Health (St. Joseph Medical Center)", "Kaiser Permanente Washington (Tacoma)", "MultiCare Good Samaritan (Puyallup)", "Madigan Army Medical Center (JBLM, TRICARE)", "VA Puget Sound &ndash; American Lake"],
